{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Return to the Classics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitar Retro Picks</strong> is a collection of 20 classic solitaire games with a nostalgic 8-bit look inspired by the early PC era. Ideal for audiobooks, podcasts, or binge-watching your favorite series.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2660\ufe0f\u00a07 <strong>\u00d7</strong> Classic Card Games <strong>-</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>Alaska,\u00a0Canfield,\u00a0FreeCell,\u00a0Forty Thieves,\u00a0Klondike,\u00a0Spider &amp;\u00a0Yukon</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666\ufe0f 7 <strong>\u00d7</strong> Specialty Card Games <strong>-</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>Accordion,\u00a0Addiction,\u00a0Monte Carlo,\u00a0Pyramid,\u00a0Poker Squares,\u00a0Scorpion\u00a0&amp; TriPeaks</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2663\ufe0f<strong>\u00a0</strong>2 <strong>\u00d7</strong> Versus CPU Card Games <strong>-</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>Gin Rummy\u00a0&amp; Hearts</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665\ufe0f 4 <strong>\u00d7</strong> Puzzle &amp; Arcade Games <strong>-</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>Minesweeper, Nuclei, Pipe Fever &amp; Mahjong</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0b Light on system resources, well-suited for Steam Deck and laptops</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbe Solvable and random modes for supported games, with auto-save, seed sharing, and optional unlimited undo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc Built-in rules for every game, plus a solution viewer for difficult seeds</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Complete Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitar Retro Picks</strong> is a passion project built to be straightforward and complete. When you purchase the game, you\u2019re getting everything. No hidden requirements. No extra costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Subscriptions</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Buy it once and own it permanently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Advertisements</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> No interruptions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Microtransactions</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> No coins, boosters, or hidden costs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeab <span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>DLC</strong></span>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> The full collection is included. No paid add-ons</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Cards &amp; Tiles -</strong> Multiple card fronts (including high-visibility), backs, and tile styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Tabletop</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Custom table backgrounds and border styles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Integration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfae <strong>Steam Deck &amp; Controllers -\u00a0</strong>Full support for controller, mouse, or keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2601\ufe0f <strong>Steam Cloud</strong>\u00a0<strong>-</strong> Sync your progress and settings across devices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achievements -</strong> Earn achievements for supported games and modes</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Freecell Dabbler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974650/d31366a035cace999119a17ca932c95a924a38d6.jpg"},{"name":"Freecell Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974650/03d41bfd04a8423fb18dd9d47caf5458c9eccda3.jpg"},{"name":"Freecell Professional ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974650/419eb058c8bd79568077f82fb0d3e1fab34c0129.jpg"},{"name":"Freecell Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com